  "name": "Fast Hands",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can do one of the following.</p><ul><li><strong>Sleight of Hand.</strong> Make a Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) check to pick a lock or disarm a trap with Thieves' Tools or to pick a pocket.</li><li><strong>Use an Object.</strong> Take the Utilize action, or take the Magic action to use a magic item that requires that action.</li></ul>",
